{"id":"9192b374640dde9c","group":"72","path":"72/72-df-tseitin-formula-encoding.md","title":"Tseitin encoding of formulas","display":"df-tseitin-formula-encoding — Tseitin encoding of formulas","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Handbook of Proof Theory","book_abbrev":"72","label":"72-df-tseitin-formula-encoding","aliases":["72-df-tseitin-formula-encoding"],"display":"df-tseitin-formula-encoding — Tseitin encoding of formulas","depends_on":["[[72-df-tseitin-gate-clauses]]","[[72-df-propositional-syntax]]"],"source_author":"Pavel Pudlák","source_edition":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998","source_location":"Chapter VIII §8.4; printed p.599; PDF p.611; finite formula closure and root clauses supplied locally","source_pdf":"C:\\Users\\lzy\\Documents\\BaiduSyncdisk\\calibre\\libgen.li\\[Studies in Logic and the Foundatio (2867)\\[Studies in Logic and the Found - libgen.li.pdf","verification_status":"definition-contract-checked","source_statement_status":"book construction compared; explicit local formulation distinguished","source_proof_status":"Finite-tree recursion, fresh naming, gate domains, and all branches checked","eligible_as_verified_dependency":true,"revision_date":"2026-10-13"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Handbook of Proof Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"72"},{"key":"label","html":"72-df-tseitin-formula-encoding"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>72-df-tseitin-formula-encoding</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-tseitin-formula-encoding — Tseitin encoding of formulas"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"1d05cd6f4ce7e0ed\" href=\"?note=1d05cd6f4ce7e0ed\" title=\"72-df-tseitin-gate-clauses\">72-df-tseitin-gate-clauses</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"d6da6d3f3489ef90\" href=\"?note=d6da6d3f3489ef90\" title=\"72-df-propositional-syntax\">72-df-propositional-syntax</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_author","html":"Pavel Pudlák"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998"},{"key":"source_location","html":"Chapter VIII §8.4; printed p.599; PDF p.611; finite formula closure and root clauses supplied locally"},{"key":"source_pdf","html":"C:\\Users\\lzy\\Documents\\BaiduSyncdisk\\calibre\\libgen.li[Studies in Logic and the Foundatio (2867)[Studies in Logic and the Found - libgen.li.pdf"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"definition-contract-checked"},{"key":"source_statement_status","html":"book construction compared; explicit local formulation distinguished"},{"key":"source_proof_status","html":"Finite-tree recursion, fresh naming, gate domains, and all branches checked"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"true"},{"key":"revision_date","html":"2026-10-13"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>命题公式构造子、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Var}\">\\(\\operatorname{Var}\\)</span> 和 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"⟦ A⟧_a\">\\(⟦ A⟧_a\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"d6da6d3f3489ef90\" href=\"?note=d6da6d3f3489ef90\" title=\"72-df-propositional-syntax\">72-df-propositional-syntax</a>；门子句 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D\">\\(D\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"1d05cd6f4ce7e0ed\" href=\"?note=1d05cd6f4ce7e0ed\" title=\"72-df-tseitin-gate-clauses\">72-df-tseitin-gate-clauses</a>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\omega\">\\(n\\in\\omega\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> 属于 Assertion 给出的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Fml}_3\">\\(\\mathsf{Fml}_3\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{SF}\">\\(\\operatorname{SF}\\)</span> 是同节沿有限公式树定义的子公式集合函数。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"q:\\operatorname{SF}(A)\\to\\mathsf{PV}\\setminus\\operatorname{Var}(A)\">\\(q:\\operatorname{SF}(A)\\to\\mathsf{PV}\\setminus\\operatorname{Var}(A)\\)</span> 为单射；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"q(B)\">\\(q(B)\\)</span> 是函数取值，不是把公式 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B\">\\(B\\)</span> 本身视为变量。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta(A,q),E^+(A,q),E^-(A,q)\">\\(\\Delta(A,q),E^+(A,q),E^-(A,q)\\)</span> 是下式引入的有限子句集合。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"S_0:=\\mathsf{PV},\\qquad\nS_{n+1}:=S_n\\cup\\{\\neg B:B\\in S_n\\}\\cup\n\\{B\\land C,B\\lor C:B,C\\in S_n\\},\\qquad\n\\mathsf{Fml}_3:=\\bigcup_{n\\in\\omega}S_n.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[S_0:=\\mathsf{PV},\\qquad\nS_{n+1}:=S_n\\cup\\{\\neg B:B\\in S_n\\}\\cup\n\\{B\\land C,B\\lor C:B,C\\in S_n\\},\\qquad\n\\mathsf{Fml}_3:=\\bigcup_{n\\in\\omega}S_n.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{SF}(p)&amp;:=\\{p\\},\\\\\n\\operatorname{SF}(\\neg B)&amp;:=\\{\\neg B\\}\\cup\\operatorname{SF}(B),\\\\\n\\operatorname{SF}(B\\circ C)&amp;:=\\{B\\circ C\\}\\cup\\operatorname{SF}(B)\\cup\\operatorname{SF}(C)\n\\quad(\\circ\\in\\{\\land,\\lor\\}).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{SF}(p)&amp;:=\\{p\\},\\\\\n\\operatorname{SF}(\\neg B)&amp;:=\\{\\neg B\\}\\cup\\operatorname{SF}(B),\\\\\n\\operatorname{SF}(B\\circ C)&amp;:=\\{B\\circ C\\}\\cup\\operatorname{SF}(B)\\cup\\operatorname{SF}(C)\n\\quad(\\circ\\in\\{\\land,\\lor\\}).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\nK_q(p)&amp;:=D(q(p),0,\\langle p\\rangle),\\\\\nK_q(\\neg B)&amp;:=D(q(\\neg B),1,\\langle q(B)\\rangle),\\\\\nK_q(B\\land C)&amp;:=D(q(B\\land C),2,\\langle q(B),q(C)\\rangle),\\\\\nK_q(B\\lor C)&amp;:=D(q(B\\lor C),3,\\langle q(B),q(C)\\rangle),\\\\\n\\Delta(A,q)&amp;:=\\bigcup_{B\\in\\operatorname{SF}(A)}K_q(B),\\\\\nE^+(A,q)&amp;:=\\Delta(A,q)\\cup\\{\\{q(A)\\}\\},\\\\\nE^-(A,q)&amp;:=\\Delta(A,q)\\cup\\{\\{\\neg q(A)\\}\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\nK_q(p)&amp;:=D(q(p),0,\\langle p\\rangle),\\\\\nK_q(\\neg B)&amp;:=D(q(\\neg B),1,\\langle q(B)\\rangle),\\\\\nK_q(B\\land C)&amp;:=D(q(B\\land C),2,\\langle q(B),q(C)\\rangle),\\\\\nK_q(B\\lor C)&amp;:=D(q(B\\lor C),3,\\langle q(B),q(C)\\rangle),\\\\\n\\Delta(A,q)&amp;:=\\bigcup_{B\\in\\operatorname{SF}(A)}K_q(B),\\\\\nE^+(A,q)&amp;:=\\Delta(A,q)\\cup\\{\\{q(A)\\}\\},\\\\\nE^-(A,q)&amp;:=\\Delta(A,q)\\cup\\{\\{\\neg q(A)\\}\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>来源为第VIII章 §8.4，印刷p.599/PDF p.611，按变量、否定、合取、析取引入新变量及定义子句。这里选取单个公式的有限子公式闭包，明确区分定义子句与额外的正/负根单位子句；书中没有单独给出本节点的两个符号 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"E^+,E^-\">\\(E^+,E^-\\)</span>。</p>\n<p>子公式集合有限，命题变量集合无限，故满足要求的单射 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"q\">\\(q\\)</span> 总可选择。自由语法构造唯一且递归下降到真子公式；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"q\">\\(q\\)</span> 单射使门输出不同于其输入，即使两个输入子公式相同仍合法。这里限定于无常元的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\{\\neg,\\land,\\lor\\}\">\\(\\{\\neg,\\land,\\lor\\}\\)</span> 基，不暗中对原语法的常元或其他联结词调用未定义分支。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"72-df-tseitin-gate-clauses","status":"resolved","id":"1d05cd6f4ce7e0ed","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-tseitin-gate-clauses]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-propositional-syntax","status":"resolved","id":"d6da6d3f3489ef90","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-propositional-syntax]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-propositional-syntax","status":"resolved","id":"d6da6d3f3489ef90","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"命题公式构造子、$\\operatorname{Var}$ 和 $⟦ A⟧_a$ 取 [[72-df-propositional-syntax]]；门子句 $D$ 取 [[72-df-tseitin-gate-clauses]]。","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-tseitin-gate-clauses","status":"resolved","id":"1d05cd6f4ce7e0ed","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"命题公式构造子、$\\operatorname{Var}$ 和 $⟦ A⟧_a$ 取 [[72-df-propositional-syntax]]；门子句 $D$ 取 [[72-df-tseitin-gate-clauses]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\operatorname{Var}","display":false},{"tex":"⟦ A⟧_a","display":false},{"tex":"D","display":false},{"tex":"n\\in\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"A","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{Fml}_3","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{SF}","display":false},{"tex":"q:\\operatorname{SF}(A)\\to\\mathsf{PV}\\setminus\\operatorname{Var}(A)","display":false},{"tex":"q(B)","display":false},{"tex":"B","display":false},{"tex":"\\Delta(A,q),E^+(A,q),E^-(A,q)","display":false},{"tex":"S_0:=\\mathsf{PV},\\qquad\nS_{n+1}:=S_n\\cup\\{\\neg B:B\\in S_n\\}\\cup\n\\{B\\land C,B\\lor C:B,C\\in S_n\\},\\qquad\n\\mathsf{Fml}_3:=\\bigcup_{n\\in\\omega}S_n.","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{SF}(p)&:=\\{p\\},\\\\\n\\operatorname{SF}(\\neg B)&:=\\{\\neg B\\}\\cup\\operatorname{SF}(B),\\\\\n\\operatorname{SF}(B\\circ C)&:=\\{B\\circ C\\}\\cup\\operatorname{SF}(B)\\cup\\operatorname{SF}(C)\n\\quad(\\circ\\in\\{\\land,\\lor\\}).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\nK_q(p)&:=D(q(p),0,\\langle p\\rangle),\\\\\nK_q(\\neg B)&:=D(q(\\neg B),1,\\langle q(B)\\rangle),\\\\\nK_q(B\\land C)&:=D(q(B\\land C),2,\\langle q(B),q(C)\\rangle),\\\\\nK_q(B\\lor C)&:=D(q(B\\lor C),3,\\langle q(B),q(C)\\rangle),\\\\\n\\Delta(A,q)&:=\\bigcup_{B\\in\\operatorname{SF}(A)}K_q(B),\\\\\nE^+(A,q)&:=\\Delta(A,q)\\cup\\{\\{q(A)\\}\\},\\\\\nE^-(A,q)&:=\\Delta(A,q)\\cup\\{\\{\\neg q(A)\\}\\}.\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"E^+,E^-","display":false},{"tex":"q","display":false},{"tex":"q","display":false},{"tex":"\\{\\neg,\\land,\\lor\\}","display":false}],"bytes":3142,"backlinks":[{"id":"00439897fba390aa","anchor":"ref-355","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[72-df-tseitin-formula-encoding|df-tseitin-formula-encoding — Tseitin encoding of formulas]]"},{"id":"70ff58eeae2491db","anchor":"ref-353","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[df-tseitin-formula-encoding — Tseitin encoding of formulas](72-df-tseitin-formula-encoding.md)"},{"id":"2e1cc33090ad6f68","anchor":"ref-56","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[72-df-tseitin-formula-encoding]]"},{"id":"4d85a6a31705a214","anchor":"ref-381","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[./72-df-tseitin-formula-encoding|df-tseitin-formula-encoding — Tseitin encoding of formulas]]"},{"id":"7ca92679e1a71b55","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$A\\in\\mathsf{Fml}_3$，$q$、$\\operatorname{SF}$、$\\Delta$ 与门子句取 [[72-df-tseitin-formula-encoding]]；$V=\\operatorname{Var}(A)$，$Q=\\operatorname{ran}(q)$，$a\\in\\{0,1\\}^V$。"},{"id":"f6f38fb4ec14b41d","anchor":"ref-56","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../72-df-tseitin-formula-encoding]]"},{"id":"29de2a641cbd0b98","anchor":"ref-331","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../72-df-tseitin-formula-encoding]]"}],"outgoing":["1d05cd6f4ce7e0ed","d6da6d3f3489ef90"]}